⍝ Quad_XML.tc vim: syntax=apl

⍝ XML errors... ==============================================================
⍝@ test3.


⍝ invalid XML character ------------------------------------------------------

⎕XML "  ", ⎕UCS20, "  "
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '  ',⎕UCS 20,'  '
      ^
)MORE
⎕XML B: Invalid XML character U+0014 at B[3]
)SIC

⍝ missing root element -------------------------------------------------------

⎕XML " "
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML,' '
      ^
)MORE
⎕XML B: no XML root element in B
)SIC

⍝ tag not closed -------------------------------------------------------------

⎕XML "<TAG attribute='25'"
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '<TAG attribute=''25'''
      ^
)MORE
No tag end found in: <TAG attribute='25'
)SIC

⍝ tag not closed -------------------------------------------------------------

      ⎕XML "<root><sub "
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '<root><sub '
      ^
)MORE
No tag end found in: <sub 
)SIC

⍝ tag too short---------------------------------------------------------------

      ⎕XML "<root><s"
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '<root><s'
      ^
)MORE
No tag end found in: <s
)MORE
No tag end found in: <s
)SIC
⍝ comment too short-----------------------------------------------------------
⎕XML "<root><!--->"
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '<root><!--->'
      ^
)MORE
⎕XML: comment not properly terminated: <!--->
)SIC

⍝ bad closing tag ------------------------------------------------------------

⎕XML '<root></#>'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '<root></#>'
      ^
      )MORE
⎕XML: bad tag name in end tag : </#>
)SIC

⍝ bad empty tag --------------------------------------------------------------
      ⎕XML '<root><#/>'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '<root><#/>'
      ^
)MORE
⎕XML: bad tag name in empty (-leaf) tag: <#/>
)SIC

⍝ bad start tag --------------------------------------------------------------

⎕XML '<root><#>'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '<root><#>'
      ^
)MORE
⎕XML: bad tag name in start tag: <#>
)SIC

⍝ unescaped < in attribute name ----------------------------------------------

      ⎕XML "<root na<me='' >"
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '<root na<me='''' >'
      ^
      )more
⎕XML B: Unescaped '<' in attribute name: '<root na<me='' >'...
)SIC

⍝ unescaped < in attribute value ---------------------------------------------

⎕XML "<root name='val<ue' >"
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕XML '<root name=''val<ue'' >'
      ^
      )MORE
⎕XML B: Unescaped '<' in attribute value: '<root name='val<ue' '...
)SIC

